  "description": "The text 'enjoying a warm cup on a cold day' is an analogical mapping that describes the visual scene. The woman in the image, sitting in the truck bed by a cold lake, is depicted as the subject performing the action of enjoying a warm beverage in a cold environment. The text explicitly labels her activity and setting, creating a direct mapping between the textual description and the visual material. This mapping is supported by her cozy attire, the presence of a thermos (implying a warm drink), and the cold, open landscape in the background, which together instantiate the concept described in the text.",
